      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The problem\nFind the maximum flow from s to t.\n\n7 vertices, 12 directed edges.\nEvery label is flow/capacity.\nNo flow yet: every edge is 0/c\nand the flow value |f| = 0.\n\nOut of s: 5 + 10 + 12 = 27\nInto t: 10 + 3 + 9 = 22\nSo the answer can never exceed 22.",
      "originalText": "The problem\nFind the maximum flow from s to t.\n\n7 vertices, 12 directed edges.\nEvery label is flow/capacity.\nNo flow yet: every edge is 0/c\nand the flow value |f| = 0.\n\nOut of s: 5 + 10 + 12 = 27\nInto t: 10 + 3 + 9 = 22\nSo the answer can never exceed 22.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
